{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04728","headline":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 一 · 张说","name":"舞马千秋万岁乐府词三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金天诞圣千秋节，玉醴还分万寿觞。\n试听紫骝歌乐府，何如騄骥舞华冈。\n连骞势出鱼龙变，躞蹀骄生鸟兽行。\n岁岁相传指树日，翩翩来伴庆云翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}